# ============================================================
#  Named conditions (docs/grimoire-script.md §9): call them in any expression, e.g. courting(lyra).
# ============================================================

@cond courting
desc: Not together and not exes: a romance with them is still open.
params: who
is: bond(who) != "partner" and bond(who) != "ex"

@cond partner_here
desc: Your partner, and around to be met in person now.
params: who
is: bond(who) == "partner" and around(who)

@cond spell_known
desc: You have learnt this spell (any level).
params: s
is: spell_level(s) >= 1

# Renown's tiers (design §8.2; the numbers match `tiers:` on @resource renown): the spotlight cards read these.
@cond renown_known
desc: The academy knows your face: renown 30 or more.
is: renown >= 30

@cond renown_famous
desc: The academy watches you: renown 60 or more.
is: renown >= 60

@cond renown_legend
desc: You are the academy's own story: renown 85 or more.
is: renown >= 85
